#
# All 14.x releases carry these HIGH CVEs; the fixes land in next 15.5.16+
# (CVE-2026-44573/44578, GHSA-8h8q-6873-q5fj), 15.0.8+ (GHSA-h25m-26qc-wcjf),
# 15.5.15 (GHSA-q4gf-8mx6-v5v3) and 15.5.21+/16.2.11 (CVE-2026-64641/64645/
