# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Frontend-only: postcss 8.4.31 nested inside next@14.2.35 (exact pin).
#
# next 14.2.35 declares postcss 8.4.31 as a direct (exact-version) dependency
# for its internal CSS pipeline; npm overrides for it are rejected (conflicts
# with the frontend's own postcss ^8 dev dependency) and the nested copy
# cannot be bumped without forking next. Clears with the next 15/16 migration
# tracked in #1199.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
CVE-2026-45623 # postcss 8.4.31 exact-pinned inside next 14.2.35; not upgradeable without next major; next 15/16 migration tracked in PR 1199 # LaPoshBaby # 2026-12-31
CVE-2026-73646 # postcss 8.4.31 exact-pinned inside next 14.2.35; not upgradeable without next major; next 15/16 migration tracked in PR 1199 # LaPoshBaby # 2026-12-31

